  "summary": "Software Engineer with a focus on low-level and systems programming. Interested in work on real-time systems, performance-sensitive desktop software, graphics, and audio.\n\nPast work includes developing firmware for custom embedded motion control hardware (C, VHDL, TCP/IP) and building desktop software to interface with and control it (C++, C#, Windows & Linux). Graduate studies included Machine Learning, Robotics and Text Mining.\n\nSee my personal site at http://ericalzheimer.com (game programming, OpenGL, custom UI, software rendering, audio, music synthesizers).\n",
